WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.660
It came out all right this time.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:25.440
<i>The Dauphin was spending yet
another night in the forge.</i>

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.210
<i>Louis-Auguste, engrossed
in hunting and locksmithing,</i>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.230
<i>hardly paid any attention to Antoinette.</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.580
<i>Husband and wife in name only,</i>

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
<i>poor Antoinette spent her nights sleeping alone.</i>

