00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.910
episode

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.910
"Who 
\h  Wrote the Love Letter"

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.060
Lady Antoinette!

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.480
Where are you going?

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.610
You're skipping out on your studies, aren't you?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.070
Well, it's no fun!

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.490
Manners! Etiquette!

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:04.950
Tradition! Formalities!

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.160
Say, Oscar.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.120
Take me horseback riding!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.220
Absolutely not!

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:11.710
What if you injure yourself?!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:17.340
Tell me, why aren't princesses allowed to
do what they want and have a little fun?

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.460
I understand how you feel,

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.430
but this is a question for the Dauphin.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.890
The Dauphin couldn't care less about me!

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.100
The only thing that's on his mind is making locks!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.650
Your Highness!

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.020
What are you doing in such a place...?

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:54.590
Every day, you're holed up in this place,
acting as though you're an artisan.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.380
Yet, you won't have a single
conversation with me.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:01.070
W-Well, u-um, I also have to go hunting, so...

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.100
It's hard to find the time...

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.560
Which is more important, me or hunting?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.940
O-Of course, you are...

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.310
Then, why?

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.520
Oh, I know!

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:14.810
This!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.240
It's for you!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.120
Are you running away from me?!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.590
Your Highness!

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:22.750
For Heaven's sake!

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:26.590
Don't you like me, Your Highness?!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.200
Do you understand?

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.500
You must never act so unladylike ever again.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.280
In Versailles,

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:40.880
there are many people who will intentionally
spread embellished gossip about you two.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.590
You mustn't give them a reason to talk!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.580
Furthermore, you shouldn't press
the timid Dauphin so hard.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.480
Do you understand?

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:52.650
You must be more mindful of
the position you are in...

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.690
Lady Antoinette!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.300
And then?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.070
What did that redheaded brat do next?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.100
Oh, you won't believe it.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:09.900
She threw a crowbar at the Dauphin,
started breaking locks, and so on.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.830
I hear it was a fiasco.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.310
I can almost see the reaction
on that Locksmith's face.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:24.010
I must make His Majesty aware
of such interesting rumors.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.350
Knives aren't the only things that can kill.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:35.900
At times, rumors can be fatal as well,
depending on the situation.

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:36.940
Fatal?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:42.900
Yes, for a person who prizes their honor, that is...

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.360
Oscar, I just don't know.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:02.960
Huh?

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.290
She's just so beautiful and lovely...

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:09.340
Well... I just don't know how to speak to her...

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.310
Everything she does and says is brilliant.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:18.440
On the other hand, I'm short,
short-legged and my stomach is bulging...

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.520
I love her very much, but...

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.070
Please keep all of that to yourself.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.610
Of course.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:31.290
I am a member of the Royal Guards,
who protects the royal couple.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.350
A fox!

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.700
We've cornered the fox!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.490
Please hurry, Your Highness.

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:38.390
R-Right...

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.990
<i>His poor Highness...</i>

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:47.470
<i>His temperament is too different
from that of the Dauphine's,</i>

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.900
<i>who acts according to her heart.</i>

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:53.140
<i>No one will probably ever
understand his kind heart.</i>

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.480
My!

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.190
My, how wonderful!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.990
His Highness is a skilled shooter.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.090
They have such beautiful coats!

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:13.730
Yes, they were hunted just a short while ago!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.360
They'll make a wonderful bonnet
and muff, Your Highness.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.970
Why not make them into a cape?

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.710
It'll bring out your fair complexion even more.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:25.870
I already own 92 bonnets and 188 capes.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.180
My, how envious!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.660
If you attend the masquerade ball in
the Opera House wearing this cape,

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.140
you'll look like a female Cossack warrior!

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.730
A masquerade ball?

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.400
Oscar.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:46.830
Mother.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:50.280
Lady Antoinette has been
waiting for you over there.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.120
Your Highness, it's Oscar.

00:07:58.610 --> 00:07:59.790
Shh! Oscar!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.250
Huh?

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.810
I'm heading to Paris incognito for some fun.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.260
For the Opera House's masquerade ball.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:06.680
You mustn't!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.180
His Majesty hasn't given his permission!

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:09.680
It'll be fine.

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:13.380
I'll be wearing a mask, so no one
will know I'm the Dauphine.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:17.050
Come with me as my bodyguard. Please, Oscar?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.060
You mustn't go, Your Highness!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.480
I hear people of low rank, such as merchants
and performers attend these balls.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.000
It's such an indecent place to go...!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.700
I'm just going to have a little look.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.070
All right, let's go.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:28.470
Your Highness, please wait!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.920
You dance so elegantly.
What is your name?

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.540
My, I couldn't tell you that.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.670
I wish I could steal you away tonight.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.340
<i>My heart aches as if it's going to burst!</i>

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.880
I never knew such an enjoyable world existed.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:20.050
When I'm here, I can forget that I'm the Dauphine.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.220
This place is like a dream compared
to my life at court!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:24.850
Mademoiselle.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:26.960
Excuse me.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:30.920
Mademoiselle, may I... have the next dance?

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.780
You must be of noble birth.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:47.360
If I may, please allow me to have a glimpse of
your elegant face, hidden beneath your mask.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.200
N-No, this is...

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.600
<i>She's better than I had imagined!</i>

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.070
<i>Such eyes...</i>

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.370
<i>Such lips...</i>

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.140
<i>Such beautiful skin tone...</i>

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.870
<i>Who could this young lady be...?!</i>

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.370
Young man, state your name.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:18.980
Your title?

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:19.560
Your rank?

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:21.550
Oscar!

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:26.850
I believe stating your name first, when asking
another his name, is considered the etiquette.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:31.390
Oscar François de Jarjayes.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.940
Commander of the French Royal Guards.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:37.930
I am Hans Axel von Fersen, a Swede.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.410
My title is Count. I've come here for my studies,
so I have no rank until I return home.

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.740
All right. In that case, von Fersen...

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.540
If you'd like to speak to this Lady,

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.420
come to the Palace of Versailles
and request a formal audience.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.950
She is the Dauphine of France.

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:55.840
Lady Marie Antoinette.

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:58.590
Lady Antoinette?!

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.510
My apologies, I did not know.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:05.340
Lord Fersen, correct?

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.060
I shall remember your name.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:16.720
Head Maid!

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.420
Get the carriage ready immediately!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:25.130
<i>When those two 18 years olds met,
what was that momentary sparkle...</i>

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:28.100
<i>...that flashed in their young eyes?</i>

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:31.330
<i>The woman promised the position of Queen...</i>

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:36.840
<i>The most beautiful woman in Versailles
whose only woes should be boredom...</i>

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:41.750
<i>The first act of her historic love
affair with the Northern Nobleman...</i>

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:46.510
<i>...had already begun before
either of them had realized.</i>

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:00.130
That brat is finally showing her true colors.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.550
She may be of royal birth and what not,

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:05.290
but her actions are the same as a flashy tramp.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.340
It makes me a little jealous though,

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:09.440
when I hear how infatuated
Count Fersen is with her.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:13.780
Yes! He dances well and is
handsome, too. He's wonderful!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.850
This will already be his third audience with her.

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:18.720
I wonder if it's wise for the Dauphin
to neglect Lady Antoinette so much.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.920
Ladies, he's here again.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.050
It's the Swede!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.290
Count Fersen?!

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.430
Let's go see him!

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:36.170
You once said that ill rumors
could be fatal sometimes...

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.780
If it develops into a scandal,
the Dauphine is finished.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.530
Also, if there's undeniable proof on top...

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.050
Say, Lord Fersen.

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:12.060
During the midnight sun, is it really
true that it's bright all day long?

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.470
Yes, for a very short period,

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:16.810
such a phenomena occurs
in the northern regions.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.570
However, I haven't heard of any reports
of people becoming sleep deprived.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.140
My, how funny!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:31.910
Have you noticed anything different
about Lady Antoinette lately?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.560
No, nothing in particular.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:37.210
She's capricious as always. Madame Noailles
is constantly giving her an earful.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:39.460
I see.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.070
If you haven't noticed it,

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.210
I guess it's nothing to be worried about yet.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.130
Are you referring to that man, Fersen?

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:51.140
Lady Antoinette is true to her heart, which
is an unusual virtue here in Versailles.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:54.610
That same virtue could also
put her in grave danger.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.940
If one ignores etiquette and tradition at Versailles,

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:01.080
and innocently act upon what's in their heart,
it would mean isolation or exile.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:03.480
I just hope nothing like that will ever happen...

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.450
Sharp as always.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:06.400
Must be a woman's intuition.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.260
Oh, I take that back.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.360
Oscar François de Jarjayes is a man among men.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:14.200
This is no time for jokes.

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:19.970
André, I need you to pay even closer attention
and stay by Lady Antoinette's side.

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:21.880
It'll be too late once a
terrible rumor has been spread.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.170
Yeah.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:00.900
<i>What is she doing dressed
like that at this hour?</i>

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:29.370
You would like me to forge a love
letter with this handwriting?

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:31.110
A passionate one.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.840
The handwriting is not very good.

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:36.840
It's a difficult job.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:38.790
1200 livres.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:43.750
Also... this ''Antoinette'' signature
will be especially hard.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.210
1400!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.660
I'll need 3 three days for
the wording of this letter.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.120
Finish it tonight.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:52.250
In return, you'll get 2000 livres!

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.560
Understood.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.060
I'll have it finished tonight then.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:25.130
''...your passionate words and your
gentle gaze from last night...''

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:51.860
Lord Fersen...

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.450
Antoinette!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.340
Fersen!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:15.080
It was fortunate that my mother found this.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.510
What if someone else had seen it?!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:19.980
What is it?

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.620
Quit your act!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.390
It's Her Highness' reply to you!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.720
Huh?!

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:27.280
No, I never wrote a letter to her!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:28.890
You coward!

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:31.900
This is definitely a reply
from Her Highness to you!

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:37.360
''I am unable to forget your passionate
words and gentle gaze from last night...''

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:39.410
Th-This is madness!

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.170
How dare you!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:44.760
Not only have you acted disgraceful towards
Her Highness, but you're insulting her, as well?!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:47.950
W-Wait, Oscar!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.240
Now you're begging for mercy?!

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.500
How spineless of you, Fersen!

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.810
I have done nothing shameful.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:55.470
As God as my witness, I swear!

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:58.450
Then, how do you explain this letter?

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.050
This is, without doubt,
Her Highness' handwriting.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.790
I don't know, but believe me!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:07.280
I have never met her in secret,
nor have I ever sent her a love letter!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.800
Oscar!

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:15.610
Wait!

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:20.870
Commander!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:21.980
Please put down your sword!

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:23.200
That letter is a forgery!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.210
A forgery? What do you mean?!

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:32.020
Open up, Razany!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.770
Damn...

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.240
He's been silenced.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:52.940
We can't prosecute without a witness.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:00.610
Commander!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:01.580
Please take a look at this!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:06.120
''My beloved Lord Fersen,
I have read your letter with much gladness...''

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.460
It's the same sentence from that letter!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:11.500
We know he did it, but the dead can't talk.

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:16.090
No, there is one other witness.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.890
Damn! We're trapped!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.140
Who would do such a thing?!

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:30.580
The window!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.270
Break the window!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.020
We have no choice!

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:44.780
Jump into the river!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.640
Such a ruthless woman...

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:01.280
She'll go to whatever lengths necessary
to destroy the evidence...

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.010
Most likely, the other witness is also...

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:33.920
My, good day, Commander Oscar.

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.540
Yesterday, there was a fire
along the river in Faubourg.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:38.550
Are you aware of this?

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:40.080
No, I wasn't aware.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.010
Still, fires are frightening, aren't they?

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.830
The charred remains of a man named Razany,
who specialized in forging letters

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.430
was discovered at the site.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.090
My, how terrifying.

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.100
And? What about it?

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.290
This was found at the site.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:57.820
There is a person here at Versailles,
who has seen the same letter.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:01.320
And in what way does that pertain to me?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.470
None...!

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:03.600
None, perhaps...!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:06.780
However, I pray that nothing of
this sort will ever be found again!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:15.270
Just... allow me to make one thing clear.

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.720
I, Oscar, Commander of the Royal Guards,

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:21.880
will protect the Dauphine with my life
from any conspiracies that may arise!

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.550
If you'll excuse me.

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:02.420
<i>Your Highness...</i>

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:05.760
<i>You are too true to your emotions.</i>

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.790
<i>You are too beautiful... and innocent like an angel.</i>

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:15.830
<i>There are many people who seek to plot against
you, by using your undoubting nature...</i>

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:20.210
<i>I just hope nothing happens
and that it all passes by...</i>

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:32.290
To be continued

